          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Located within Toynbee Hall’s restored building, The Ashbee Hall reflects over 130 years of East London heritage. The space retains its elegant proportions while offering full modern connectivity, air conditioning and high-quality finishes throughout. It’s the perfect blend of historic charm with contemporary facilities."
        },
